          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On December 13, 1977, between 7:00 and 7:30 PM, several witnesses in different regions of France observed the rapid east-west passage in the sky of a circular, luminous phenomenon followed by a trail. Most of these observations lasted a few seconds and no particular noise was heard. Based on the descriptions provided, these individuals were likely witnesses to an atmospheric reentry.",
